# Generated run output only. The phase1 SOURCE — escalation_state.py,
# escalation_runner.py, error_signature.py, v20_specs.py, fixtures/,
# tests/ — is the actual contribution and must stay tracked; this file
# exists solely to keep run artifacts out, mirroring the root
# .gitignore's existing results/**/... rules for phase0's (differently
# rooted) results tree, which don't reach into phase1/ because they're
# anchored relative to the repo root.
#
# __pycache__/, *.pyc, .pytest_cache/ are already ignored repo-wide by
# the root .gitignore (those patterns have no internal slash, so they
# apply at any depth) — not repeated here.

results/
